 that shot  to literally enter people's bodies and  manipulate them from the inside at  incredible speeds and we saw this  ability in action when he entered  kurogiri's body and instantly knocked  him out from the inside during the  hideout radar so when you really think  about it the idea of headshot being able  to perform emergency medical procedures  from the inside does make sense he is  able to enter people's bodies instantly  and make modifications to the bodies of  those people so with a lot of practice  and training it's not too far-fetched to  think that headshot could even perform  emergency surgery on the battlefield but  this is something that should have been  established earlier if edshot had been  established as a renowned medical ninja  at an earlier point in the story kind of  like tsunade from naruto then him being  able to literally bring characters back  to life wouldn't seem just like plot  armor for bakugo and because horikoshi  didn't lay the groundwork for this  earlier we get what is probably the  silliest and stupidest panel in all of  mha headshot brings out a little bubble  and says that laundry hero washu had  given him this special bubble at some  point in the past and headshot will now  use that bubble to cleanse bakugou's  body before performing his procedure now  this does make some sense from a medical  perspective because you need to keep  everything clean during surgery in order  to avoid infection and some other type  of contamination so if headshot had been  established as a medical ninja who  carries some sort of first aid kit along  with him at all times then we could  understand that maybe he keeps such  bubbles inside a special section of that  first aid kit for emergency uses such as  this one but since no such thing has  been established we are now left  wondering why in the world headshot  keeps a little bubble with him during  battles and where he keeps this bubble  in the first place i mean it's a bubble  and even though it's a special bubble  are we really supposed to believe that  headshot can engage in a brutal fight  against shigaraki with that bubble  somewhere on his person without the  bubble ever popping like what anyway  after the bubble incident headshot  proceeds to make his body so thin that  it can serve as a surgical tool but  stretching his body to that extreme  degree drains headshot's life force and  can kill him in the process that is the  whole sacrifice aspect that we talked  about in the previous chapter however  headshot feels that he has no choice  because despite genus best efforts to  sew up bakugou's wounds bakugo's heart  is still bleeding and badly damaged and  his lungs are also wounded so without  immediate surgical intervention he will  die and genus won't be able to save him  using his quirk headshot is able to mend  bakugou's organs from the inside and the  outside and he can even give bakugo cpr  from inside his body which drastically  increases the chances that bakugou could  be successfully revived headshot wants  miruko and the other heroes to keep  fighting because shigaraki is mortal and  he can bleed as well they just have to  hold out a little bit longer until  bakugou is brought back to life because  apparently bakugou is the strongest and  most important hero in existence so  saving him should be everyone's priority  even at the cost of their own lives  meanwhile shigaraki is surprised to see  genus and headshot still desperately  trying to help bakugou he already  destroyed bakugou earlier so why are  these people still trying to save him  the thought of bakugo being saved after  shigaraki believed that he had already  destroyed him in rages shigaraki who  feels that the only way to stop his  incessant itching is to keep destroying  everything there is literally no amount  of therapy that can help this man  although i'm sure that deku will try  shigeraki then tries lunging at bakugo  and the others but the fierce myriko  stops him with yet another furious  attack she ends up losing her other arm  in the process and i mean no wonder her  body is falling apart when she has to  carry this entire freaking chapter all  on her own seriously though i am  legitimately annoyed now by how  horikoshi keeps treating miroko why does  she have to take on all these injuries  while the number 3 and 4 strongest pro  heroes are both just sitting there and  risking their lives to save one hero  student instead of oh i don't know  trying to take shigaraki down and save  literally everyone else maybe i'm just  upset about my bunny waifu but let me  know what you guys think about how this  all went down in the comments below  kudos to miroko though she is an  absolute hero legend and i think she's  now even surpassed mario leona when it  comes to being the top badass female  character in modern shonen eventually  media also joins the fight to hold back  shigaraki and that's about the time that  shigaraki notices something he seems to  be actually taking on damage and  accumulating it which surprises him  because that's not supposed to be  happening to him with his new perfect  body shigeraki then seems to hint at the  fact that bakuga's attacks may have hurt  him earlier and that is why he is now  accumulating damage i wasn't 100 clear  on this point and if that was the case  then it might kind of explain why the  heroes are so desperate to save bakugo  if his new howitzer impact cluster was  able to deal real damage to shigaraki  then maybe we can justify the fact that  3 of the top 5 pro heroes are currently  risking their lives just to save him but  none of this was ever made clear to us  and even if this was the case we have no  idea if the heroes are even aware of it  and yes in case you need a reminder  genius headshot and miracle are the  current third fourth and fifth strongest  pro heroes and all three of them are  currently risking everything just for  bakugo horikoshi please make it make  sense miroko once again laughs at death  and declares that she will give it her  all because she is not going to die with  any regrets she uses a move called luna  rush to actually land some hits on  shigaraki despite her severe injuries  and shigaraki is in disbelief even  though he thought that he had broken the  heroes and that they had no chance of  defeating him they are still fighting  against all odds and they are risking  their lives to help each other even when  it seems like there is no hope of  success this makes shigaraki remember  his own family and childhood and how no  one was there to help him when he needed  it even before he was a broken man his  family didn't support him and after  everything that happened then he became  broken no one was there to help him out  except for all for one everyone just  pretended not to see him and this is  what fueled his endless rage and desire  for destruction in that moment something  seems to snap inside of shigaraki and  some of his hand mutations begin to take  the form of his dead family members the  final page refers to these clones of  shigaraki's family as a newly unleashed  power that is threatening the heroes so  we can assume that these clones will be  fighting against the heroes alongside  shigaraki and since the heroes are  already barely surviving even with a  single shigaraki the only way that this  makes sense is if the heroes end up  getting a massive reinforcement very  soon one possibility is that deku will  finally arrive on the scene after all  this time but another possibility is  that bakugou will be successfully  brought back to life now one would  assume that even if his organs start  working again bakugou will still be too  injured to fight however if headshot's  procedure and sacrifice are able to  fundamentally change bakugou's body from  within then perhaps he will awaken with  a new found power a new quirk altogether  and this will allow him to get back into  the fight and that is what we need to  talk about now the possibility that  headshot and bakugo will somehow fuse  and that this will lead to bakugou's  quirk explosion fusing with headshots  quirk fold a body this will then create  a new super quirk that will allow  bakugou to actually put up a fight  against shigaraki until daku arrives now  at first glance explosion and foldabody  don't seem particularly compatible  explosion is an emitter type quirk and  fulda body is a transformation type  quirk and they function on a completely  different basis bakugo's quirk allows  him to excrete sweat into his palms that  has the properties of nitroglycerin and  he then uses that nitroglycerin to  create explosions headshot's quirk  allows him to stretch his body and  control its thinness while also moving  at incredible speeds clearly these are  two very different quirks with extremely  different effects but bakugo's latest  super move howitzer impact cluster may  provide some clues to what a fusion  between these two quirks might look like  as chapter 362 revealed the cluster  upgrade that bakugou devised came with a  side effect that he wasn't aware of the  act of saving up sweat into launchable  beads put a huge burden on the glands of  his palms eventually the beads of  nitroglycerin that were stored up could  no longer remain in the palms and so  they began leaking all over his body  this created small explosions throughout  bakugo's body which gave him even more  speed but this also had the effect of  causing immense pain to bakugou and  eventually it damaged his body and  organs but if bakugo's entire body were  to become flexible and extendable as a  result of some sort of fusion with  folder body then in theory he would be  able to protect his organs while still  creating explosions all over his body  and to make himself faster and more  effective in battle basically bakugou  may be able to turn his body into an  exploding beyblade that moves with  immense speed while launching hundreds  of explosions all around it at the same  time bakugou will be able to keep all of  his vital organs safe by stretching them  out of harm's way so he will essentially  become a swirling exploding inferno that  cannot be stopped until it connects with  its target and that target is of course  shigaraki don't get me wrong i realize  this is a stretch but it is one possible  way that explosion and folder body could  fuse in a way that makes bakugou a key  player in the fight once again what do  you guys think could bakugou's quirk  fuse with headshots quirk in order to  create a new super quirk if so what  would that quirk look like do you like  my exploding beyblade idea or do you  have some other ideas of your own let me  know down in the comments below i would  love to hear some great concepts for  this fusion as we await the next chapter  as always if you enjoyed this video  leave a quick like right now it helps me  out a lot and if you haven't taken the  time to subscribe yet remember it's  completely free and it is a huge help to  us here on the channel you can also hit  me up on twitter and instagram at  animeopror as always thank you guys so  much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys

